WEBVTT

00:00:35.460 --> 00:00:39.380
I see... So these people 
are the 6 Holy Knights.

00:00:40.060 --> 00:00:41.730
So who won?

00:00:44.480 --> 00:00:46.280
Nobody's won yet.

00:00:46.280 --> 00:00:49.530
Well, it's not like they're 
much to worry about.

00:00:49.840 --> 00:00:53.030
Baby Beel lost interest 
halfway in and fell asleep.

00:00:57.930 --> 00:00:59.930
Oh, that's rare.

00:01:00.190 --> 00:01:02.490
Are you really so curious 
about these 6 Holy Knights?

00:01:03.460 --> 00:01:06.870
Didn't you search 
for the rest of them?

00:01:07.910 --> 00:01:09.500
Well, about that...

00:01:09.500 --> 00:01:11.210
No, I can't!

00:01:11.210 --> 00:01:15.690
I don't dare say! Not even to you, Brother!

00:01:16.010 --> 00:01:19.890
They know how strong you are 
now from that last fight,

00:01:20.360 --> 00:01:24.640
and if you defeat the 6 Holy Knights, 
you'll be expelled for sure!

00:01:24.890 --> 00:01:28.520
...is what he said. Kazu 
wouldn't tell me, the jerk.

00:01:28.820 --> 00:01:32.720
Therefore, you don't know 
who the 6 Holy Knights are.

00:01:32.720 --> 00:01:35.610
On the contrary! There 
is one way we can tell!

00:01:36.610 --> 00:01:37.650
That's...

00:01:38.150 --> 00:01:40.620
...the emblem in the shape of a lion!

00:01:41.500 --> 00:01:47.600
So you have absolutely no issues with 
making that sort of entrance now?

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:34.980
<b>Who Are the 6 Holy Knights?</b>

00:03:35.790 --> 00:03:38.130
In other words, the people 
who are the 6 Holy Knights

00:03:38.130 --> 00:03:41.360
hide an emblem of a lion 
underneath their collars.

00:03:41.610 --> 00:03:44.740
Right. On the front, it's a normal pin badge,

00:03:44.740 --> 00:03:46.870
so you can't just tell at a glance.

00:03:46.870 --> 00:03:49.500
Who did you hear this from?

00:03:50.220 --> 00:03:52.030
You're gonna be shocked...

00:03:52.030 --> 00:03:53.620
It's Miki! Remember him?

00:03:54.440 --> 00:03:55.460
Miki...

00:03:56.980 --> 00:03:58.430
Who was that again?

00:03:58.430 --> 00:04:00.960
Who? You forgot?

00:04:00.960 --> 00:04:02.260
Back in middle school...

00:04:02.260 --> 00:04:07.260
Anyway, we're gonna use those emblems as 
clues and find the rest of the 6 Holy Knights!

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:31.370
Looking around, I don't see 
anyone wearing a pin badge.

00:04:39.930 --> 00:04:40.820
There's one!

00:04:41.810 --> 00:04:45.080
But he doesn't look like one 
of the 6 Holy Knights to me...

00:04:53.710 --> 00:04:55.710
Are you even really searching?

00:04:57.880 --> 00:04:59.940
Oga-san and Furuichi-san!

00:05:10.170 --> 00:05:11.830
Azusa, what are you doing?

00:05:11.830 --> 00:05:14.060
Don't talk to them! Get back here!

00:05:14.060 --> 00:05:16.450
'Kay! I'm coming!

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.420
See you later!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:22.340
Did you see?

00:05:22.660 --> 00:05:24.500
Yeah, it was Moyashi-kun.

00:05:25.020 --> 00:05:26.480
Has she always worn that?

00:05:27.640 --> 00:05:28.930
I don't remember.

00:05:29.690 --> 00:05:32.720
Is she in some kind of club 
that does power-training?

00:05:32.720 --> 00:05:36.520
No... I'm pretty sure she said she 
was in the arts and crafts club.

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:38.270
Arts and crafts?

00:05:51.150 --> 00:05:53.050
What kind of knitting is that?!

00:05:53.050 --> 00:05:58.080
I suppose you could call her the most 
powerful at being oblivious, but...

00:05:58.080 --> 00:06:00.170
Seriously, that can't be it.

00:06:00.830 --> 00:06:05.630
Just in case, I will go 
verify the truth myself.

00:06:06.290 --> 00:06:07.260
How?

00:06:07.260 --> 00:06:10.590
During gym class, I will sneak 
into the girls' locker room.

00:06:10.590 --> 00:06:13.850
Um, that's clearly a criminal act.

00:06:17.140 --> 00:06:18.910
What is it, Baby Beel?

00:06:23.680 --> 00:06:26.300
What? Leave it to me, you say?

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:30.650
I see! It might be a crime for us,

00:06:30.650 --> 00:06:32.750
but an innocent baby can get away with it!

00:06:32.990 --> 00:06:35.430
We can just let Baby Beel find out!

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:40.390
Um, can I have a sec?

00:06:41.880 --> 00:06:43.220
What is it?

00:06:43.220 --> 00:06:44.770
Will you try holding him?

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:48.450
W-What is he doing?

00:06:48.450 --> 00:06:54.350
And right after he tells me. "Hey, 
why don't you just be his mother?"

00:06:55.360 --> 00:06:59.090
What he really wants is a young, cute girl?

00:06:59.450 --> 00:07:02.210
He has no use for a strong woman?

00:07:02.210 --> 00:07:06.440
Now it has to be some woman who you 
instinctively want to protect?!

00:07:10.390 --> 00:07:11.830
Calm down.

00:07:11.830 --> 00:07:16.410
After all, I've never seen that baby 
get along with any other girls.

00:07:19.600 --> 00:07:21.420
He totally likes her!

00:07:24.530 --> 00:07:25.640
Queen?

00:07:25.640 --> 00:07:26.670
What are you doing?

00:07:27.920 --> 00:07:29.670
N-Nothing!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:33.210
Anyway, what are you guys doing here?

00:07:34.400 --> 00:07:36.590
We're searching for the 6 Holy Knights.

00:07:37.430 --> 00:07:38.770
6 Holy Knights?

00:07:40.510 --> 00:07:42.730
What about the 6 Holy Knights?

00:07:43.420 --> 00:07:45.420
Nothing! It's nothing...

00:07:45.650 --> 00:07:46.790
The jig's up.

00:07:46.790 --> 00:07:48.160
We're gonna get it!

00:07:56.670 --> 00:07:59.840
Oh, you want this badge that much?

00:07:59.840 --> 00:08:01.010
Want it?

00:08:02.900 --> 00:08:03.670
You sure?

00:08:05.540 --> 00:08:08.910
Yeah! It's just a freebie from a magazine.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:17.410
Oh! You're searching for 
the 6 Holy Knights' emblems.

00:08:17.410 --> 00:08:20.180
There's no way she's one of them.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:22.810
Well, she <i>is</i> in the Arts and Crafts Club.

00:08:22.810 --> 00:08:26.320
Anyway, do you know who 
the 6 Holy Knights are?

00:08:26.600 --> 00:08:28.690
Kazu, the jerk, won't tell me.

00:08:28.690 --> 00:08:31.800
I'm not really into that sort of thing.

00:08:32.060 --> 00:08:36.450
Oh, yeah! A person in the Amateur 
Radio Club wears a badge...

00:08:36.450 --> 00:08:38.530
Amateur Radio Club?

00:08:38.530 --> 00:08:40.230
Does that make him strong?

00:08:40.630 --> 00:08:44.600
No... It's about as unbelievable 
as the Arts and Crafts Club.

00:08:46.940 --> 00:08:48.290
We've got trouble, Madam Aoi!

00:08:48.290 --> 00:08:49.800
Kanzaki's...

00:08:55.400 --> 00:08:59.600
Madam Aoi, I'm sorry. We 
tried to stop him, but...

00:08:59.600 --> 00:09:01.170
Why'd this happen?

00:09:01.540 --> 00:09:03.520
They did in Shiroyama.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:07.770
Surprisingly Kanzaki blew 
a fuse and headed out.

00:09:09.700 --> 00:09:12.130
That guy just does whatever 
he damn well pleases.

00:09:12.130 --> 00:09:15.200
Even though you treated 
him the shittiest of all.

00:09:16.610 --> 00:09:21.370
It's the first time I've ever 
seen him look like that.

00:09:29.710 --> 00:09:33.980
Not gonna stop him now. It's war.

00:09:38.580 --> 00:09:41.220
Tell us exactly what happened.

00:09:41.220 --> 00:09:42.990
You see, we...

00:09:42.990 --> 00:09:45.980
They knew we couldn't fight back.

00:09:46.240 --> 00:09:48.810
Hey look, it's the gang ladies!

00:09:49.150 --> 00:09:51.250
Whoa, I've never seen one before!

00:09:51.500 --> 00:09:53.440
Not bad, I say!

00:09:54.940 --> 00:09:57.750
I like it, kind of refreshing.

00:09:58.180 --> 00:09:59.910
Did you make those lunches yourself?

00:09:59.910 --> 00:10:01.160
Hey.

00:10:03.070 --> 00:10:05.360
You have some business with our class?

00:10:05.600 --> 00:10:07.030
Not really.

00:10:07.030 --> 00:10:09.300
We were just talking with them!

00:10:09.300 --> 00:10:10.670
Somethin' wrong with that?

00:10:11.290 --> 00:10:12.860
Get going you two.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:17.710
Hey, wait up!

00:10:18.780 --> 00:10:20.540
What's with that?

00:10:20.540 --> 00:10:23.450
Yeah! We were totally serious.

00:10:23.450 --> 00:10:26.730
You call yourself a man getting in 
the way of people's path to love?

00:10:27.350 --> 00:10:32.020
Sorry about that. To apologize, 
you can each punch me once.

00:10:32.020 --> 00:10:33.230
That way we're even.

00:10:34.870 --> 00:10:36.350
Is this guy serious?

00:10:36.350 --> 00:10:38.550
People say that in real life?!

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:40.130
So lame!

00:10:40.130 --> 00:10:41.940
O-shi-yama indeed!

00:10:43.200 --> 00:10:44.240
Okay, I'll go first.

00:10:46.800 --> 00:10:48.440
Not even a reaction...

00:10:48.440 --> 00:10:52.210
Okay, then I'll use this!

00:10:52.210 --> 00:10:54.500
Ooh, good! Go with that!

00:10:55.670 --> 00:10:57.800
Ready, set...

00:11:02.180 --> 00:11:04.100
Then, Shiroyama...

00:11:04.490 --> 00:11:06.650
We called an ambulance...

00:11:06.650 --> 00:11:08.850
He's flat on his back in the hospital.

00:11:13.120 --> 00:11:16.450
Man, feels nice after you do a good deed!

00:11:16.680 --> 00:11:19.390
Let's do another 2 or 3 just like that.

00:11:25.770 --> 00:11:28.450
I've come to kill you all.

00:11:45.590 --> 00:11:47.610
What are you doing? Hurry!

00:11:47.850 --> 00:11:51.300
Well, I think it's too late.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:01.950
I see? So it was you two who did it.

00:12:01.950 --> 00:12:04.380
Do you understand what 
they're gonna do to you now?

00:12:04.380 --> 00:12:05.700
You're totally expelled!

00:12:11.710 --> 00:12:13.890
Like I care! So what?

00:12:14.130 --> 00:12:16.090
Don't underestimate Ishiyama!

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:18.460
Kanzaki, wait!

00:12:19.060 --> 00:12:20.490
Stay outta this!

00:12:20.490 --> 00:12:23.460
I'm gonna pay them back for 
what they did to Shiroyama.

00:12:24.090 --> 00:12:26.110
This won't do, Senpai.

00:12:26.880 --> 00:12:27.800
Miki!

00:12:27.800 --> 00:12:31.980
At this rate, it looks like 
I'm going to have to stop you.

00:12:31.980 --> 00:12:33.850
Miki, help me!

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:35.810
What did you say, punk?

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:53.850
Kanzaki!

00:12:57.080 --> 00:12:58.110
Miki!

00:13:06.590 --> 00:13:10.680
Baby Beel, how about it? This guy 
seems like one of the 6 Holy Knights.

00:13:12.950 --> 00:13:15.190
He says "Anybody but you."

00:13:15.570 --> 00:13:17.760
It's been a long time, Oga.

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:22.980
I'm surprised that we'd meet again like this.

00:13:23.710 --> 00:13:25.890
They know each other?

00:13:25.890 --> 00:13:29.000
Yeah... We were in the same 
grade in middle school.

00:13:29.000 --> 00:13:32.470
But he wasn't like this back then.

00:13:33.290 --> 00:13:35.650
Anyway, let's carry Kanzaki out of here.

00:13:35.650 --> 00:13:37.680
Oga, lend a hand!

00:13:40.310 --> 00:13:42.850
So that was Kanzaki-kun of the TKKH?

00:13:42.850 --> 00:13:45.840
Is that what Ishiyama calls top-level?

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:48.840
He's provoking you. You can't fight with him.

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.520
I won't.

00:13:50.770 --> 00:13:52.700
What do you take me for?

00:13:52.700 --> 00:13:55.350
That's how you talk, but you're 
flashy with your fists.

00:13:55.350 --> 00:14:00.350
You ignore the trouble you cause everyone, 
and puff yourself up with mindless violence.

00:14:00.740 --> 00:14:03.110
All delinquents are the same.

00:14:03.110 --> 00:14:05.130
Yeah, yeah! Go away!

00:14:05.130 --> 00:14:07.360
You're causin' us trouble, you punks!

00:14:07.360 --> 00:14:15.280
Go away! Go away! Go away! Go away! Go away!

00:14:15.280 --> 00:14:18.670
It was you idiots who started it!

00:14:22.020 --> 00:14:23.800
If we win here, we lose.

00:14:23.800 --> 00:14:26.200
Oh? You stopped her?

00:14:26.680 --> 00:14:30.550
Too bad. I thought I could 
get another one expelled.

00:14:31.870 --> 00:14:33.580
We're leaving.

00:14:34.060 --> 00:14:36.930
Oh, yes... Guests from Ishiyama,

00:14:36.930 --> 00:14:40.940
please come to the roof of the 
old school building after school.

00:14:40.940 --> 00:14:43.570
We 6 Holy Knights will be awaiting you.

00:14:43.570 --> 00:14:46.540
You'll be sure to come, Oga-kun, won't you?

00:14:47.520 --> 00:14:51.070
It's weird. You're acting like you know me...

00:14:52.520 --> 00:14:54.870
Who are you, again?

00:15:02.710 --> 00:15:07.640
And you came back just like that? Pitiful.

00:15:07.640 --> 00:15:13.860
Kanzaki is one thing, but the rest of 
you're damaging Ishiyama's reputation.

00:15:13.860 --> 00:15:16.100
Them's fightin' words, Himekawa.

00:15:17.890 --> 00:15:21.270
Is that something you say to person 
who fought for his friend?!

00:15:21.270 --> 00:15:24.650
Stop this! No fighting among allies!

00:15:24.650 --> 00:15:29.070
Allies? Don't be ridiculous, Queen.

00:15:29.070 --> 00:15:31.160
When did we become allies exactly?

00:15:34.220 --> 00:15:36.150
Are you going to the roof?

00:15:36.150 --> 00:15:37.670
Of course I'm going!

00:15:37.670 --> 00:15:41.140
You can't! You'll be falling 
right into their hands!

00:15:42.530 --> 00:15:44.130
Everyone's at odds...

00:15:44.130 --> 00:15:47.310
How can I get everyone to work together?

00:15:47.310 --> 00:15:49.170
Hey Oga, you too...

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:51.110
Where's Oga?

00:15:51.110 --> 00:15:52.200
He ain't here.

00:15:52.200 --> 00:15:53.370
He went home?

00:15:53.370 --> 00:15:55.680
Could he have gone alone, that crazy fool?

00:15:57.410 --> 00:16:00.650
Wait, Oga! This is clearly a trap!

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:01.810
Why are you going?

00:16:01.810 --> 00:16:04.780
Furuichi, don't jump to conclusions.

00:16:05.150 --> 00:16:07.330
I'm just going to take a 
look at the 6 Holy Knights.

00:16:10.510 --> 00:16:12.450
Oga-chan's gone home.

00:16:12.450 --> 00:16:15.950
Then, I guess I'll go home too.

00:16:15.950 --> 00:16:16.870
Natsume...

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.000
Hold it!

00:16:18.000 --> 00:16:20.980
Hey now, what're you actin' all cool for?

00:16:21.400 --> 00:16:24.640
I'm gonna <i>go home</i> way before all of you.

00:16:48.900 --> 00:16:50.880
What kind of joke is this?

00:16:50.880 --> 00:16:54.240
You're gonna fight us alone?

00:16:54.240 --> 00:16:57.810
I don't see 6 Holy Knights... 
Two are missing, fool.

00:16:57.810 --> 00:17:00.910
But four-on-four is just 
about right, don't you think?

00:17:04.420 --> 00:17:08.420
Which one was it that did in 
Kanzaki-kun and Shiro-chan?

00:17:08.420 --> 00:17:13.670
Not like I really care, but I have to 
repay you for underestimating my Ishiyama.

00:17:13.670 --> 00:17:17.180
Just so you know, I only 
came here to stop them.

00:17:20.670 --> 00:17:24.690
Nice... So, which one 
of you is the strongest?

00:17:26.270 --> 00:17:27.390
Furuichi-san!

00:17:28.140 --> 00:17:32.140
Oh, Yamamura-kun... You show 
up at just the right times.

00:17:32.140 --> 00:17:34.650
This war is seriously starting!

00:17:34.650 --> 00:17:38.450
And wait, shouldn't you be 
out there, Furuichi-san?

00:17:39.950 --> 00:17:42.720
W-What are you saying, Azusa?

00:17:42.720 --> 00:17:44.510
Furuichi-san is The Strategist!

00:17:44.510 --> 00:17:46.320
R-Right!

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.910
I've got a great plan!

00:17:47.910 --> 00:17:49.920
I knew you would!

00:17:49.920 --> 00:17:51.130
What kind of plan?

00:17:52.500 --> 00:17:53.740
I can't say yet.

00:17:53.740 --> 00:17:58.670
By the way, Yamamura-kun... There's a scary 
looking one that's not wearing a uniform...

00:17:58.670 --> 00:18:00.390
Is he also one of the 6 Holy Knights?

00:18:00.390 --> 00:18:03.370
That's Go-senpai from the Amateur Radio Club.

00:18:03.370 --> 00:18:04.970
Amateur Radio Club?

00:18:04.970 --> 00:18:08.270
Seriously? And he's strong?

00:18:08.270 --> 00:18:09.940
Seriously strong.

00:18:09.940 --> 00:18:14.880
He's been in world-class ARDF 
orienteering tournaments

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:17.860
that are said to require 
mental and physical stamina!

00:18:17.860 --> 00:18:22.410
World-class? Well putting it that 
way, it seems pretty amazing.

00:18:22.410 --> 00:18:25.350
What's wrong? Let's get started already.

00:18:25.350 --> 00:18:29.140
And don't say wimpy crap like, "If 
I fight back, I'll be expelled"!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:33.870
This'll just take a few seconds.

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:48.060
I can't let you fight the 
big boss right away, can I?

00:18:52.560 --> 00:18:54.400
Moe, once again.

00:19:08.170 --> 00:19:14.370
Oh, you noticed? If that wasn't a wooden 
sword, you'd be dead on the spot.

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:16.100
Nae.

00:19:14.990 --> 00:19:18.060
<b>Note: Nae means "to wither", the opposite of moe (literally)</b>

00:19:16.670 --> 00:19:18.060
Himekawa...

00:19:18.060 --> 00:19:24.950
Don't stop me, Queen. I've got to teach this 
guy the difference between fighting and sports.

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:35.650
What's wrong? Going to give me 
one of your idiotic quizzes?

00:19:35.650 --> 00:19:37.320
Now, come at me!

00:19:45.920 --> 00:19:48.530
I was planning that from the start.

00:19:48.990 --> 00:19:50.770
Awesome, Brother!

00:19:51.040 --> 00:19:52.500
He flew back!

00:19:55.500 --> 00:19:56.960
H-He's standing!

00:19:56.960 --> 00:19:58.010
Seriously?

00:19:58.470 --> 00:20:01.460
I cannot lose.

00:20:01.760 --> 00:20:04.010
Not to some delinquents like you...

00:20:06.010 --> 00:20:11.450
You are students at our school, yes? 
Stand back, these people are dangerous.

00:20:11.450 --> 00:20:15.790
You can never tell when more 
delinquents will come to attack...

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:20.490
Alex!

00:20:23.480 --> 00:20:26.260
Get distracted, and you'll end up like him.

00:20:29.240 --> 00:20:33.270
One man down! You're up next.

00:20:35.740 --> 00:20:39.270
A one-hit KO on Shinjo-senpai, eh?

00:20:40.360 --> 00:20:43.760
As crazy as ever I see, Oga...

00:20:44.700 --> 00:20:48.420
Sorry about this... Watch Baby Beel for me.

00:20:48.890 --> 00:20:50.790
I'll fight him.

00:20:50.790 --> 00:20:53.770
Can you win? He's crazy strong.

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:56.530
I can't tell what style it is,

00:20:56.530 --> 00:21:00.710
Perhaps he's studied Chinese 
techniques and can use fa jin.

00:21:01.920 --> 00:21:03.740
You think I'll lose?

00:21:06.170 --> 00:21:07.280
No, I do not.

00:21:09.390 --> 00:21:13.290
The two of them together might 
have been able to beat me...

00:21:13.290 --> 00:21:16.290
You want to fight me, right?

00:21:16.750 --> 00:21:21.730
In that case you didn't have 
to go around punching Kanzaki.

00:21:22.640 --> 00:21:26.800
I'd fight you whenever and wherever you want!

00:21:27.720 --> 00:21:30.170
Yeah, that's it...

00:21:30.810 --> 00:21:34.060
That's the Oga I looked up to...

00:21:39.000 --> 00:21:41.310
Now, prove to me...

00:21:41.550 --> 00:21:44.700
...that I've already far surpassed you!

00:21:44.930 --> 00:21:49.930
I've told you before... I don't 
know who the heck you are!

00:21:52.210 --> 00:21:57.210
Be careful Oga... If he lands one 
punch, you'll need an ambulance!

00:23:41.440 --> 00:23:43.270
Oh, crap, Furuichi-san!

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:45.610
Hurry and start the plan!

00:23:46.140 --> 00:23:48.360
N-Not yet!

00:24:02.250 --> 00:24:04.020
Okay, let's get this party started!

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:05.750
You're just watching, so shut up.

00:24:05.750 --> 00:24:07.250
Look at the fun you're having.

00:24:07.740 --> 00:24:09.390
Cut me in on it!

00:24:09.390 --> 00:24:10.510
Let's fight.

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:13.030
As you can see, Tojo enters 
the fray next time!

00:24:13.030 --> 00:24:15.320
All the 6 Holy Knights 
gather for a grand climax!

00:24:15.320 --> 00:24:16.510
Who in the world will grab victory?

00:24:16.510 --> 00:24:18.020
Will it be Oga? Or Tojo?

00:24:18.260 --> 00:24:20.160
Or could it be the 6 Holy Knights?

00:24:20.160 --> 00:24:23.250
On the next Beelzebub: No 
Conclusion Was Reached!

00:24:23.250 --> 00:24:25.150
Oops, guess we just spoiled it.

00:24:25.150 --> 00:24:28.500
Don't worry. We might not finish things, but 
afterwards there's a shocking development!
